      "chunk_id": "5feea154-dae9-493a-b80d-a17187b6ab2b",
      "content": "Policy Scope\n\nThis policy covers vendor onboarding, business travel booking, equipment requests, shipping, and operations exceptions. It applies to employees, managers, HR Admins, and IT Admins who request operational support.\n\nFinance controls reimbursement and procurement thresholds. Legal controls contract review. IT controls device security. This Operations policy explains process ownership and routing.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002011",
      "document_id": "OPS-001",
      "document_title": "Vendor, Travel, and Equipment Operations Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "6e54582d-2f82-4e3b-a832-1117ce09a2e1",
      "content": "Overlap With Other Policies\n\nExpense reimbursement follows Finance policy. Contract signature follows Legal policy. Device configuration and data security follow IT security policy. When policies overlap, the stricter approval path applies.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002011",
      "document_id": "OPS-001",
      "document_title": "Vendor, Travel, and Equipment Operations Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "2f70e93f-c560-4b48-8a79-caa4306033ef",
      "content": "Exceptions\n\nEmergency expenses are allowed when waiting for approval would create a customer, employee safety, or business-continuity risk. The employee must document the emergency and obtain manager approval within three business days.\n\nRecurring exceptions must be converted into a purchase order or department budget request. Finance does not approve repeated one-off exceptions for predictable monthly costs.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002007",
      "document_id": "FIN-001",
      "document_title": "Expense, Procurement, and Reimbursement Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
