        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "7a7d5ae9-d0ec-448e-972f-f4303132fd00",
      "content": "Related Policies\n\nDevice requirements are defined in the Device and BYOD Security Policy. Data handling requirements are defined in the Data Classification and Handling Policy.",
